that license is provided in the repository's LICENSE file.

The build can download PDFium binaries from run-llama/pdfium-binaries.
PDFium and its bundled third-party components have separate license notices;
see THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md and the LICENSE/licenses directory included in the
downloaded PDFium archive.

The layout implementation uses PP-DocLayoutV3 from
PaddlePaddle/PP-DocLayoutV3_onnx at revision
46bbdf188bb0a772c08aed74882ce7e51a8f1ea6. The model is Apache-2.0 and is
downloaded separately; it is not distributed in this source repository or in
the Rust crates.

The Rust runtime integrates the ort crate and ONNX Runtime. Their licenses and
the geo crate dual license are recorded in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md. Python
oracle dependencies are development/test tools only and are not part of the
Rust runtime packages.
